        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo NLP-206, 6 Inch Narrow Latch Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very narrow security door latch protector is 6\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building) that require a very narrow plate (only 1-1/2\" wide). For use with mortise locks and key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock). Available in Primer, Silver or Dark Bronze painted finishes\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your commercial hollow metal entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel 6\" narrow security latch protector plate. The mounting studs are concealed welded to the back side of the security plate leaving no visible point of attack from the outside. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  Longer <a href=\"/products/10-inch-narrow-latch-guard-plate-don-jo-nlp-210\"><b>Don-Jo NLP-210 10\" Narrow Door Latch Guard</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-NLP-206_size.gif?v=1704354603\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo NLP-206 Narrow Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo NLP-206 Narrow Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 1/4-20 x 1-3/4\" flat head machine screws and finishing washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NLP-206.pdf?v=1704262349\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo NLP-206 Narrow Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
