                "description": "Don-Jo NLP-206 - This very narrow security door latch protector is 6 inches high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building) that require a very narrow plate (only 1-1/2 wide). For use with mortise locks and key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock). Available in Primer, Silver or Dark Bronze painted finishes",
